DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Vector");
BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle -6, 10, 0 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle 4, 8, -6 \rangle `]

Compute:
- [` \vec{u} \cdot \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-6, 10, 0>") . Compute("<4, 8, -6>")}
- Enter a unit vector in the direction of [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{unit(Compute("<4, 8, -6>"))}
- [` \vec{u} \times \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-6, 10, 0>") x Compute("<4, 8, -6>")}
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-6, 10, 0>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-6, 10, 0>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- [` \left\| \vec{u} \right\| = `] [_____]{norm(Compute("<-6, 10, 0>"))}

---

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle 9, 2, 2 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle -7, 6, -9 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{w} = \langle 2, 8, 2 \rangle `]

Compute:
- Enter a unit vector in the direction of [` \vec{w} `]. [_____]{unit(Compute("<2, 8, 2>"))}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{w} `]. [_____]{Compute("<2, 8, 2>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- [` \vec{w} \cdot \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<2, 8, 2>") . Compute("<-7, 6, -9>")}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-7, 6, -9>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-7, 6, -9>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}

---

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle -6, 9, 0 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle 10, -3, 2 \rangle `]

Compute:
- [` \vec{v} \times \vec{u} = `] [_____]{Compute("<10, -3, 2>") x Compute("<-6, 9, 0>")}
- [` \vec{v} \cdot \vec{u} = `] [_____]{Compute("<10, -3, 2>") . Compute("<-6, 9, 0>")}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{Compute("<10, -3, 2>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-6, 9, 0>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
